WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.719 --> 00:00:02.989
DAVID HARBOUR
I've gotta be honest, I'm pretty excited

00:00:03.039 --> 00:00:06.256
about joining the
Marvel Cinematic Universe as Red Guardian.

00:00:07.250 --> 00:00:08.512
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
You're officially a superhero!

00:00:08.562 --> 00:00:09.419
You've got the suit.

00:00:09.469 --> 00:00:11.466
ALEXEI SHOSTAKOV
[Grunts] Still fits.

00:00:11.516 --> 00:00:12.325
DAVID HARBOUR
That is true.

00:00:12.375 --> 00:00:14.097
FLORENCE PUGH
And you have the superhuman strength.

00:00:15.318 --> 00:00:16.737
DAVID HARBOUR
That is also true.

00:00:16.787 --> 00:00:19.029
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
You've got that unbridled charisma.

00:00:22.201 --> 00:00:24.151
DAVID HARBOUR
Well, you know, I mean... [Laughs]

00:00:24.201 --> 00:00:28.611
I guess you can say, Red Guardian
is like the Russian Captain America.

00:00:30.748 --> 00:00:33.081
SCARLETT JOHANSSON
I mean, you could say that.

00:00:33.131 --> 00:00:36.239
FLORENCE PUGH
Yeah, we wouldn't say that, but you could.

00:00:36.289 --> 00:00:37.856
DAVID HARBOUR
Good!

00:00:37.906 --> 00:00:39.664
I will say it! I'm the Russian...

